Follow `/AGENTS.md` as the authoritative agent workflow.

Before work, read `/PROJECT.md` and `/CURRENT.md`. Read `/STYLE.md` for copy, layout, design, or case-study changes. If `/TASK.md` exists, stay within its scope and acceptance criteria.

